@Portfoliosite_BackendHostAddress = http://localhost:5086
@testPassword = {{$dotenv PORTFOLIO_TEST_PASSWORD}}

### Register a user account
POST {{Portfoliosite_BackendHostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "name": "New User"
}

###

### Log in and receive an authentication cookie
POST {{Portfoliosite_BackendHostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

###

### Log out and clear the authentication cookie
POST {{Portfoliosite_BackendHostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
